# Merge Sort Algorithm - Vivarane

Namaskara! Computer Science professor aagi, naanu nimage merge sort bagge sampoorna vivarane kodtini.

## Merge Sort Hege Kelasa Madutte?

Merge sort **"Divide and Conquer"** (vibhajisi gellu) tantra balasutte. Idu mooru hejjegalalli kelasa madutte:

1. **Divide (Vibhajane):** Array annu eradu samana bhagagalaagi vibhajisutte, ondu element matra ulivavaregu.

2. **Conquer (Gellu):** Pratiyondu chikka bhagavannu recursively sort madutte.

3. **Merge (Vilina):** Sort aada bhagagalannu maralu serisi ondu sorted array maadutte.

```
Udaharane: [38, 27, 43, 3]

        [38, 27, 43, 3]
         /          \
    [38, 27]      [43, 3]
     /    \        /    \
   [38]  [27]   [43]   [3]
     \    /        \    /
    [27, 38]      [3, 43]
         \          /
        [3, 27, 38, 43]
```

## Bubble Sort Jote Comparison

| Vishaya | Merge Sort | Bubble Sort |
|---------|-----------|-------------|
| **Time Complexity (Best)** | O(n log n) | O(n) |
| **Time Complexity (Average)** | O(n log n) | O(n²) |
| **Time Complexity (Worst)** | O(n log n) | O(n²) |
| **Space Complexity** | O(n) | O(1) |
| **Stability** | Stable | Stable |
| **Doddha data** | Tumba vegavaagi | Tumba nidhaana |

## Merge Sort na Prayojanagalu (Benefits)

1. **Vegavaada Performance:** O(n log n) yaavaglu, doddha datasets ge tumba uttama. Bubble sort O(n²) ge holisidare, dodda dattu ge merge sort tumba vegavaada.

2. **Predictable (Khachitavaada):** Yaavude sandharbhadalliyu O(n log n) — best, average, worst ellaa onde.

3. **Stable Sort:** Samana elementugala kramavannu ulisikolluttte.

4. **Parallel Processing:** Vibhajisida bhagagalannu prtyekvaagi sort maadabahudu.

**Tondaregalu (Drawbacks):**
- Heccu memory beku (O(n) extra space)
- Chikka arrays ge bubble sort vEga aagiruvudu

## Rust Implementation

```rust
fn merge_sort(arr: &[i32]) -> Vec<i32> {
    // Base case: ondu athava sonne element iddare, adu already sorted
    if arr.len() <= 1 {
        return arr.to_vec();
    }

    // Divide: array annu eradu bhagavaagi vibhajisi
    let mid = arr.len() / 2;
    let left = merge_sort(&arr[..mid]);
    let right = merge_sort(&arr[mid..]);

    // Conquer & Merge: eradu sorted bhagagalannu serisi
    merge(&left, &right)
}

fn merge(left: &[i32], right: &[i32]) -> Vec<i32> {
    let mut result = Vec::with_capacity(left.len() + right.len());
    let mut i = 0; // left index
    let mut j = 0; // right index

    // Eradu arrays nalli compare madutta serisutta hogi
    while i < left.len() && j < right.len() {
        if left[i] <= right[j] {
            result.push(left[i]);
            i += 1;
        } else {
            result.push(right[j]);
            j += 1;
        }
    }

    // Uliyuvva elementugalannu serisi
    while i < left.len() {
        result.push(left[i]);
        i += 1;
    }

    while j < right.len() {
        result.push(right[j]);
        j += 1;
    }

    result
}

fn main() {
    let numbers = vec![38, 27, 43, 3, 9, 82, 10];
    println!("Modalu (Original): {:?}", numbers);

    let sorted = merge_sort(&numbers);
    println!("Sort aada nantara: {:?}", sorted);
}
```

**Output:**
```
Modalu (Original): [38, 27, 43, 3, 9, 82, 10]
Sort aada nantara: [3, 9, 10, 27, 38, 43, 82]
```

## Saaramsha (Summary)

- Merge sort **dodda data** ge bubble sort gintha tumba **uttama**
- Iddu **khachitavaada** performance kodutte (yaavaglu O(n log n))
- Aadre **heccu memory** balasutte

